  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "第三天，我负责盘货、搬东西，许棠负责查设备。",
      "characters": 18,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 108,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "监控室旁边的休息室，被我们收拾了出来。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 108,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 210,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "她有了自己的床。",
      "characters": 7,
      "start_frame": 210,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 252,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "我的被子，也终于不用总铺在椅子上。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 252,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 342,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "水和清洁用品分开，常温粮和临期食品分开。",
      "characters": 18,
      "start_frame": 342,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 450,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "吃剩的包装及时收走，通道一直留空。",
      "characters": 15,
      "start_frame": 450,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 540,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "我们还清出了备用电的设备间。",
      "characters": 13,
      "start_frame": 540,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 618,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "油箱里有油，但能撑多久，得看我们怎么用。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 618,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 720,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "每天晚上，我们先定第二天吃什么，再定第二天做什么。",
      "characters": 22,
      "start_frame": 720,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 852,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "她喝热牛奶不放糖。",
      "characters": 8,
      "start_frame": 852,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 900,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "我总想多拿一袋肉干。",
      "characters": 9,
      "start_frame": 900,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 954,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "她不拦我，只让我吃完记得在清单上减掉。",
      "characters": 17,
      "start_frame": 954,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1056,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "半夜交班，她把温好的牛奶放在了桌上。",
      "characters": 16,
      "start_frame": 1056,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1152,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "我第一次放心地关上休息室的门。",
      "characters": 14,
      "start_frame": 1152,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1236,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "外面仍然有丧尸。",
      "characters": 7,
      "start_frame": 1236,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1278,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "可我睡着的时候，终于有人替我看着那扇门了。",
      "characters": 19,
      "start_frame": 1278,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1392,
      "gap_after_frames": 0,
      "timing_basis": "text_estimate_not_audio_aligned"
    }
  ],
